---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Games Not Recommended for DroidDeck — DroidDeck Guide"
  description="Games that currently run poorly or not at all on DroidDeck. Save your storage space and avoid these titles for now."
  page="games"
>
  <style>
    .page-header{background:var(--night);color:white;padding:90px 0 50px}
    .page-header h1{font-size:36px;margin-bottom:12px}
    .page-header p{color:#93a7ba;max-width:600px}
    .page-content{padding:50px 0 80px}
    .game-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;font-size:14px}
    .game-table th,.game-table td{padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left;vertical-align:top}
    .game-table th{background:#f4f7fa;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--muted)}
    .game-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
    .fps-low{font-weight:700;color:#dc2626}
    .note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
    .source-badge{font-size:11px;padding:3px 10px}
  </style>
  
    <section class="page-header">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="hero-label"><span></span> Game Compatibility</div>
        <h1>Not Recommended List</h1>
        <p>Games that currently crash, run below 15 FPS, or have severe graphical issues on DroidDeck. Check back after updates.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-content wrap">
      <div style="overflow-x:auto">
        <table class="game-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Game</th>
              <th>Issue</th>
              <th>Why it fails</th>
              <th>Source</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Starfield</strong></td>
              <td><span class="fps-low">Unplayable</span></td>
              <td class="note">DX12 and heavy CPU/GPU demands exceed current mobile hardware.</td>
              <td><span class="source-badge source-community"><i class="ri-user-community-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Community</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Baldur's Gate 3</strong></td>
              <td><span class="fps-low">Unplayable / crashes</span></td>
              <td class="note">Vulkan/DX11 compatibility issues and very high RAM usage.</td>
              <td><span class="source-badge source-community"><i class="ri-user-community-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Community</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Hogwarts Legacy</strong></td>
              <td><span class="fps-low">Crashes on launch</span></td>
              <td class="note">DX12 unsupported or unstable on current DroidDeck builds.</td>
              <td><span class="source-badge source-community"><i class="ri-user-community-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Community</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Forza Horizon 5</strong></td>
              <td><span class="fps-low">Crashes / black screen</span></td>
              <td class="note">Anti-cheat and DX12 issues prevent launch.</td>
              <td><span class="source-badge source-community"><i class="ri-user-community-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Community</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Cyberpunk 2077</strong></td>
              <td><span class="fps-low">Crashes / 10–15 FPS</span></td>
              <td class="note">Extremely heavy GPU/RAM requirements and DX12 issues.</td>
              <td><span class="source-badge source-community"><i class="ri-user-community-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Community</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Alan Wake 2</strong></td>
              <td><span class="fps-low">Crashes on launch</span></td>
              <td class="note">Mesh shaders and DX12 features not supported on Adreno.</td>
              <td><span class="source-badge source-community"><i class="ri-user-community-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Community</span></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="note" style="margin-top:20px"><span class="source-badge source-community"><i class="ri-user-community-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> Community</span> reports only. If a future DroidDeck update fixes one of these games, please <a href="/submit-report/">submit a report</a> so we can move it to the playable list.</p>
    </section>
  
  
</Layout>
